    {
      "title": "Prakash Raj, Dhruv Rathee join hands with Dipke, stage protest against SIR",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/politics/prakash-raj-dhruv-rathee-join-hands-with-dipke-stage-protest-against-sir-126100800621_1.html",
      "description": "CJP founder Abhijeet Dipke, YouTuber Dhruv Rathee and actor-activist Prakash Raj led a protest here on Thursday against CEC Gyanesh Kumar, demanding his immediate resignation over alleged irregularities in the SIR of electoral rolls.\nProtesters from various walks of life, including women and students, gathered in large numbers at Freedom Park and the mood dramatically turned electric, with unceasing slogan-shouting, demanding the scrapping of the SIR exercise and asking Gyanesh Kumar to step down.\nAccording to the organisers, the protest, a people's tribunal for the victims of SIR from across Karnataka, will be followed by a \"Chappal protest\" in solidarity with women.\n\"Error 404 - Name Not Found\", and \"It's done bro, resign sir\" and \"Don't erase us, hear us,\" were among the slogans found on posters waved by protesters.\nSome protesters also raised slogans like \"Dictatorship will not be tolerated\", \"vote theft\", \"Gyanesh Kumar Gaddi leave your chair.\"\nPosters featuring freedom fight",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-10-08T08:49:02"
    },
    {
      "title": "INDIA bloc MPs to stage bigger protest against CEC Gyanesh Kumar today",
